WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.566
A fluid that computes.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.205
A compiler turns a machine into a force.

3
00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.310
A tagged particle arrives when it halts.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.910
Encode the tape as numbers, run each step with shear flows.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.386
Claimed: reaching the region is undecidable, in general.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.979
Lean checks part.
